   "design": "Crews record jobs, hours per job and materials in the field app ({OPS_SYSTEM}), which builds the monthly site report per client and a weekly activity dashboard for the manager. The supervisor checks each site report; only then is it sent to the client. Certificates and incidents go into the HR system ({HCM}) with fixed fields, never sickness causes.",
