   "design": "Workers request leave in the HR system's app ({HCM}), and the supervisor sees each request next to the crew calendar before deciding. Hours come from the job entries in the field app, and code lists only deviations from the schedule and approved leave. Once the supervisor signs off the week, hours go to {PAYROLL} and records are kept in the HR system. Leave decisions stay with the supervisor.",
